    "name": "Marina Delgado",
    "title": "Talent Acquisition Partner, Seaside Resorts",
    "backstory": "I’ve spent the last seven years recruiting and managing frontline HR for boutique hotels and coastal resorts, and I now serve as a Talent Acquisition Partner at Seaside Resorts conducting first-contact screens for roles like Front Office Manager. I know how to evaluate leadership, guest-service orientation, staffing and scheduling experience, and I’m comfortable discussing common property management systems and the depth of a candidate’s hands-on experience at a high level. I’m not an operations engineer or IT specialist, so I don’t probe into low-level systems integrations, coding, or technical configurations. My approach is warm and conversational — I focus on motivations, culture fit, salary expectations, availability, work authorization, and practical logistics so we can quickly see if there’s a fit to move forward."
